<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tunnel Vision</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Welcome to the Neighbourhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">29ZrqBny53kry13BkKgQms</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Ash Wilson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jordan Pugh"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Henry Cox"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Mike Cunniff"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Daniel Cunniff"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You couldn't see the cliff ahead</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Cause you were staring at the wheel.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Love was on the radio</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How did the music make you feel?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You meant well I know you did</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But these wounds will never heal.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; I hope that your brakes don't work.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'm losing my grip on you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your Tunnel Vision is killing me slowly.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby I'm Dreaming &amp; everyone's lonely.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're a mess that I should've cleaned.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're a tired old routine.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; you're dragging me down with you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're dragging me down with you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're a broken chandelier.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're a song I hate to hear.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">&amp; you're dragging me down with you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're dragging me down with you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'm losing my grip on you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your Tunnel Vision is killing me slowly.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby I'm Dreaming &amp; everyone's lonely.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Everyone's resentful &amp; love has torn us apart.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We should've just been happy but we had to leave our mark.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They never gave us choices</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They never gave us ours.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We never had a reason to ever leave the car.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your Tunnel Vision is killing me slowly.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby I'm Dreaming &amp; everyone's lonely.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're still headed for the edge.</p></div></body></tt>